  <entry>
    <title>golang 下反射 plugin 中的类型实例实现动态注入</title>
    <link href="http://titanxxh.com/2021/03/31/golang-dynamic-injection/"/>
    <id>http://titanxxh.com/2021/03/31/golang-dynamic-injection/</id>
